(19, 'B6.5', 5, 'Standard Work', 'Document the current best method with takt, sequence, and inventory.'),
(19, 'B6.6', 6, '5S and Visual Management', 'Create a self-explaining, self-cleaning workplace.'),
(19, 'B6.7', 7, 'Design for Six Sigma (DMADV)', 'Define, Measure, Analyze, Design, and Verify a new process or product.'),
